    skos:altLabel "financial option selection" ;
    skos:altLabel "portfolio decision act" ;
    skos:altLabel "asset allocation choice" ;
    skos:definition "An information processing act where an investor or advisor selects a specific financial investment option from a set of available alternatives. This process involves evaluating risk profiles, return expectations, and portfolio constraints to determine the final investment allocation. The act culminates in the formal selection of the chosen financial value for portfolio integration. An information processing act where an investor or advisor selects a specific financial investment option from a set of available alternatives. This process involves evaluating risk profiles, return expectations, and portfolio constraints to determine the final investment allocation." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_FILLER_INVESTORFUNDINGSITUATION> a skos:Concept ;
