    skos:altLabel "legal professional" ;
    skos:altLabel "qualified legal advocate" ;
    skos:altLabel "licensed legal practitioner" ;
    skos:altLabel "legal practitioner" ;
    skos:altLabel "legal counsel" ;
    skos:definition "A legal professional denotes an individual who possesses formal legal qualifications and actively performs advocacy duties within a recognized legal framework. Practitioners reference this term when documenting licensed attorneys, legal advisors, or advocates who represent clients in judicial proceedings, draft legal instruments, or provide specialized legal counsel. The role emphasizes the formal accreditation and active practice of law, distinguishing the individual by their authorized capacity to navigate legal systems and deliver professional legal services. Used in legal practice and regulatory contexts to identify individuals who hold formal qualifications and actively engage in legal advocacy, such as attorneys, barristers, or solicitors, within a jurisdiction." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

