    skos:definition "A dissemination channel that utilizes online media. This term describes communication pathways that leverage internet infrastructure, such as websites, social media platforms, or digital messaging systems, to distribute information to target audiences. Applies to digital communication pathways that leverage internet infrastructure for information dissemination. Practitioners use this term when designing or analyzing outreach strategies that rely on websites, social media, or digital messaging platforms." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_GENERIC> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_FILLER_OPERATIONALDISRUPTION> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Filler Operationaldisruption" ;
    skos:notation "1.123" ;
    skos:altLabel "FILLER_OPERATIONALDISRUPTION" ;
    skos:altLabel "Operational Disruption" ;
    skos:altLabel "Operational Area Stasis" ;
    skos:altLabel "Process Interruption" ;
    skos:altLabel "Operational Stasis" ;
    skos:altLabel "Service Disruption" ;
    skos:definition "Operational Disruption refers to a state of stasis in artifact operationality that impacts an operational area, resulting in a temporary halt or reduction of normal activities. This condition affects the ability to perform tasks, utilize resources, or deliver services within the designated operational area. The disruption may involve delays, pauses, or interruptions in the execution of processes, impacting the efficiency and effectiveness of operations. This term identifies a state of halted or impaired operational activity within a specific operational area, affecting the delivery of services or functions. It represents a temporary cessation or reduction in the normal functioning of processes, systems, or resources within the defined operational context." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS_FILLER_OPERATIONALEFFECTIVENESS> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Filler Operationaleffectiveness" ;
    skos:notation "1.124" ;
    skos:altLabel "FILLER_OPERATIONALEFFECTIVENESS" ;
    skos:altLabel "Operational Area Evaluation" ;
    skos:altLabel "Operational Stasis Assessment" ;
    skos:altLabel "Area Effectiveness Measure" ;
    skos:altLabel "Operational Performance State" ;
    skos:altLabel "Area Evaluation Stasis" ;
    skos:definition "An operational stasis that evaluates an operational area. The stasis captures the state where performance metrics, resource allocation, and outcome measures are assessed within a specific operational area to determine effectiveness. This operational stasis evaluates an operational area by measuring performance metrics within defined boundaries. The stasis applies in military, emergency response, or organizational contexts where area effectiveness is assessed through structured evaluation." ;
    skos:broader <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_PROCESS> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg/scheme> .

<https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#SDG_MATERIAL_ENTITY_FILLER_OPERATIONALEQUIPMENT> a skos:Concept ;
