    skos:altLabel "Organizational Wellbeing Metric" ;
    skos:altLabel "Workforce Health Metric" ;
    skos:definition "An organizational health metric quantifies employee wellbeing, workplace safety, or cultural health through structured survey data. The term encompasses indicators derived from employee feedback, engagement assessments, or health evaluations used to monitor workforce conditions and improve organizational performance. Applies when measuring employee wellbeing, workplace safety, or organizational culture through survey data. This term covers metrics derived from employee feedback, engagement surveys, or health assessments." ;
